  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting efficiency and accountability of security sector institutions (Infrastructure &amp; trainings)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to ensure selected police stations are staffed and equipped to perform their duties in line with best practices, in particular with regard to mediation and the elimination of Sexual- and Gender-based Violence (SGBV) as outlined in section 4 - results  to be identified in the identification/formulation phase). Such component is essential to achieve the improvement of management processes expected through the first component (technical assistance to central level).</narrative>
  </description>
